# Puppetmaster Blues (battlefield.puppetmaster_blues#helper, Talacca Cove): Five at the entry, all five enter: main
# (accepted, both key items), bob (accepted, switch only), cat (completed), dan (chip only) and eve (nothing). Only the
# registrant is held to the quest and the key items (a member passes isValidEntry, the entry NPC). The win sends the
# 32001 to all five: the first two without the skip flag, the last three with 1. The finish runs the quest's 32001
# (PuppetmasterBlues.cs): main takes the key items (keyitems +169:00) and Prog 2. bob's finish does the same.
lists TalaccaCove/_1l0/onTrigger TalaccaCove/onEventUpdate/32000 TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32000 TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
char bob zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
char cat zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
char dan zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
char eve zone=TalaccaCove pos=-100,-9.399,-85 job=PUP lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues accepted
keyitem ToggleSwitch
keyitem ValkengsMemoryChip
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues accepted
bob: keyitem ToggleSwitch
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues completed
dan: keyitem ValkengsMemoryChip
login
bob: login
invite bob
bob: accept
cat: login
invite cat
cat: accept
dan: login
invite dan
dan: accept
eve: login
invite eve
eve: accept
trigger _1l0
update 32000 option=33
finish
bob: trigger _1l0
bob: update 32000 option=33
bob: finish
cat: trigger _1l0
cat: update 32000 option=33
cat: finish
dan: trigger _1l0
dan: update 32000 option=33
dan: finish
eve: trigger _1l0
eve: update 32000 option=33
eve: finish
kill VALKENG
finish
bob: finish
cat: finish
dan: finish
eve: finish
tick 11000
